------------------------------------------------------------------------------
De-identification
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These files are a de-identified derivative of the ALLIANCE stakeholder survey.
The 40 item responses (Q1..Q40) are unchanged. Direct and quasi-identifying
fields were removed or coarsened: submission timestamps dropped; pilot cases
recoded to the codes P1..P7; age binned into bands; rare organisation types
pooled into "Other"; respondents relabelled R01..R42. DATA_CHANGES.md
documents the exact transformations.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Conditions of use
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The files contain survey responses from human participants. At n = 42, some
residual risk of re-identification remains despite the coarsening. Anyone
using the data must:
  1. make no attempt to identify or contact individual respondents or their
     organisations, and not link the data with other sources for that purpose;
  2. report any suspected disclosure risk to the authors (contact details in
     the accompanying article), so that the files can be reviewed;
  3. cite the accompanying article and this repository.
